<Project>
  <!--

    This file is used by PopulateReferenceHintPaths.targets to populate the <HintPath> of <Reference> elements automatically.

    When you multi-target an assembly, for either Winzor, .net core or both, then this file will need to be
    updated. Every reference to that newly multi-targeted assembly will now use the multi-targeted version
    automatically, without having to update any of the <Reference> elements.

    For more information on automatic population of reference hint paths, see: https://github.com/WiseTechGlobal/Modernization.Content/blob/main/Controls/populate-reference-hint-path-automatically.md

    <CWReferenceStatus> properties:
      HasNetFramework - set to 'false' for an assembly that is not present in .netframework dir. defaults to true.
      HasNetCore - set to 'true' for an assembly that is multi-targeted to .net core. defaults to false.
      HasWinzor - set to 'true' for an assembly that has a winzor-specific build. defaults to false.
  -->
